<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00071/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把瑞士军刀，主刀在拔出后5秒会变长至40米。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██特工王██的私人物品存放柜<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">放置于特工王██的私人物品存放柜</span>放置于Site-CN-██异常军用物品保管库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我允许你先跑39米！——特工王██<br />
老王，别激动，把刀放下！——研究员杨██<br />
这把刀还是很有价值的，关键时刻能派上用场。我建议将它收归基金会。——Dr.Lee<br />
同意。项目已被回收。——Site-CN-██站点主管</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00071" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00071" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00071-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevenxu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6326265); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6326265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607525411" alt="DrStevenXu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6326265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevenxu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6326265); return false;">DrStevenXu</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587095999 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Apr 2020 03:59</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00194/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>項鉬媌述：</strong>壹(1)支嘿銫圓銖筆。鉂砽項鉬書瀉の傼茡，以忣媌述垓項鉬の傼茡嘟鱂桧被轉换爲煋芠。Letters except Chinese characters will not be affected.<br />
<strong>迴収ㄖ期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>迴収地點：</strong>深zんeи鈰████汏㙾<br />
<strong>當椾狀態：</strong>被収容玗Site-CN-██低價ィ直粅ρiη収容匮。</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00194" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00194" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00194-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607525411" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
